  "spiritual_reading": "# Spiritual Sense Translation\n\n** ¶2:** Know that in each of the five orders of external truths with which the Divine Human cloth ed Himself, there d well five complete fac ulties of spiritual life. Each order contains its own fullness, and full ness multipl ied through every degree yields the total form of the regener ate mind. For when the Divine infl ux — the Word going forth — descended into the lower regions of the human mind, the capacity for reception in the will desired to ascend together with it. And the Divine calling joined with the human will 's obedient reception constit utes twenty-five fac ulties in the twenty-five functions of the spiritual human form — these being the living tru ths born from the Divine Human . Through these regenerated faculties, both the desc ending influx and the ascending reception are raised into interior and celestial states.\n\n**¶ 3:** Just as the Divine Human Himself was elevated through these very faculties, so through the same principle all things in both the interior mind and the exterior mind are established in their order.\n\n**¶4:** From that first ordering until the time when Divine Wisdom itself was made fully manifest — the glory of the Lord appearing — the n ourishment of the interior life, which is the union of Divine calling and the will 's reception , became the spiritual sustenance of every faculty. Through a complete cycle of interior states, this living sust enance proved sufficient for all the mind 's powers . It filled every faculty with spiritual capability , with abundance of goods and truths, and with life from the Divine. Wisdom itself , as this living sustenance, brought the whole mind into the fullness of spiritual wealth .",
